[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 67 The weekend Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
    "start": 0.73,
    "end": 9.951,
    "zh": "第67课 周末 听录音,然后回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "第67課 週末 聽錄音,然後回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "What are the Johnsons going",
    "start": 10.876,
    "end": 13.377,
    "zh": "约翰逊一家打算",
    "zh_hant": "約翰遜一家打算"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "to do at the weekend?",
    "start": 13.027,
    "end": 15.418,
    "zh": "周末做什么？",
    "zh_hant": "週末做什麼？"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "Hello.",
    "start": 17.779,
    "end": 18.599,
    "zh": "你好。",
    "zh_hant": "你好。"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "Were you at the butcher's?",
    "start": 19.12,
    "end": 21.441,
    "zh": "你在肉店吗？",
    "zh_hant": "你在肉店嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "Yes, I was.",
    "start": 21.781,
    "end": 23.622,
    "zh": "是的，我在。",
    "zh_hant": "是的，我在。"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "Were you at the butcher's, too?",
    "start": 23.822,
    "end": 26.743,
    "zh": "你也在肉店吗？",
    "zh_hant": "你也在肉店嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "No, I wasn't.",
    "start": 27.424,
    "end": 29.885,
    "zh": "不，我不在。",
    "zh_hant": "不，我不在。"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "I was at the greengrocer's.",
    "start": 30.785,
    "end": 33.707,
    "zh": "我在蔬菜水果店。",
    "zh_hant": "我在蔬菜水果店。"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "How's Jimmy today?",
    "start": 34.247,
    "end": 36.268,
    "zh": "吉米今天怎么样？",
    "zh_hant": "吉米今天怎麼樣？"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "He's very well, thank you.",
    "start": 37.129,
    "end": 40.11,
    "zh": "他很好，谢谢。",
    "zh_hant": "他很好，謝謝。"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "Was he absent from school last week?",
    "start": 41.131,
    "end": 45.112,
    "zh": "他上周缺课了吗？",
    "zh_hant": "他上週缺課了嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "Yes, he was.",
    "start": 45.713,
    "end": 47.734,
    "zh": "是的，他缺了。",
    "zh_hant": "是的，他缺了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "He was absent on Monday,",
    "start": 48.214,
    "end": 51.075,
    "zh": "他星期一缺课，",
    "zh_hant": "他星期一缺課，"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "Tuesday, Wednesday and Thursday.",
    "start": 51.056,
    "end": 55.077,
    "zh": "星期二、星期三和星期四也缺了。",
    "zh_hant": "星期二、星期三和星期四也缺了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "How are you all keeping?",
    "start": 55.878,
    "end": 58.399,
    "zh": "你们大家都好吗？",
    "zh_hant": "你們大家都好嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "Very well, thank you.",
    "start": 59.5,
    "end": 61.781,
    "zh": "很好，谢谢。",
    "zh_hant": "很好，謝謝。"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "We're going to spend three days in the country!",
    "start": 62.341,
    "end": 66.763,
    "zh": "我们要去乡下待三天！",
    "zh_hant": "我們要去鄉下待三天！"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "We're going to stay at my mother's",
    "start": 67.504,
    "end": 70.885,
    "zh": "我们要住在我母亲家",
    "zh_hant": "我們要住在我母親家"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "for the weekend.",
    "start": 70.605,
    "end": 72.326,
    "zh": "过周末。",
    "zh_hant": "過週末。"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "Friday, Saturday and Sunday",
    "start": 73.447,
    "end": 77.068,
    "zh": "星期五、星期六和星期天",
    "zh_hant": "星期五、星期六和星期天"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "in the country!",
    "start": 76.968,
    "end": 78.469,
    "zh": "都在乡下！",
    "zh_hant": "都在鄉下！"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "Aren't you lucky!",
    "start": 78.989,
    "end": 81.328,
    "zh": "你们真幸运！",
    "zh_hant": "你們真幸運！"
  }
]
